{"source_file": "/content/drive/MyDrive/Agronomy_Data_Source/ca8167en.pdf", "source_name": "ca8167en.pdf", "page_start": 76, "page_end": 76, "section": null, "extraction_method": "pymupdf", "text": "SOIL HEALTH FOR PADDY RICE\na. Field observation form for transect walk\nDescribe the main areas of the village\nand the surroundings\n(for example, crops, resources,\nforests, soils and info needed for the\nmap)\nHow are the soils in those areas? (let the interviewee describe;\nfor example, good bad, colour,\ncompaction or other aspects they\nconsider)\nDescribe usual farming practices\n(for example, soil preparation,\ntransplanting, fertilization, crop\nprotection, weeding, harvesting)\nDescribe major crop production\nconstraints observed\n(for example, pests, water shortage,\nbad soil condition, labour shortage)\nMajor livestock/aquaculture\nproduction constraints observed\n(feed, shelter, disease, others)\nDescribe community efforts to\nimprove soil health\nObserve recycling of waste and byproducts from livestock and agriculture\nproduction to enhance crop production\n(for example, How is straw from rice\nfield used? How is cattle manure\nused? How are vegetable residues\nfrom homestead garden used?)\nHave FFSs or other training for\nfarmers been conducted? If so report what kind of training and\nwhat kind of support they received\n(for example, from local governors,\nprivate agency etc.)\n1-9\n➔\n\n[TABLE 1]\na. Field observation form for transect walk | |\n10 | Describe the main areas of the village\nand the surroundings\n(for example, crops, resources,\nforests, soils and info needed for the\nmap) |\n11 | How are the soils in those areas? (let the interviewee describe;\nfor example, good bad, colour,\ncompaction or other aspects they\nconsider) |\n12 | Describe usual farming practices\n(for example, soil preparation,\ntransplanting, fertilization, crop\nprotection, weeding, harvesting) |\n13 | Describe major crop production\nconstraints observed\n(for example, pe